Study content (scope note)

The MIT grant above covers the source code in this repository.

The study content under `content/` is a mix of material written by the
repository author and material adapted from community-shared AIGP study banks
circulated by other exam candidates (see the Credits section of README.md and
the attribution comments in the source). The author does not claim exclusive
ownership of the community-derived items and cannot license them to you.

That content is shared here for personal, non-commercial study use only. If you
are the author of any item and want it credited differently or removed, open an
issue and it will be actioned.

No official IAPP exam content is reproduced in this repository. Not affiliated
with or endorsed by the IAPP.
